OL,3,GEast                                   
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBreaks in    
OL,6,Fthe cloud will allow temperatures to   
OL,7,Ffall and a frost to form towards dawn. 
OL,8,FIt will gradually become cloudier      
OL,9,Ftowards the west however, with patchy  
OL,10,Flight rain possible here by the        
OL,11,Fmorning. Feeling chilly with light     
OL,12,Fwinds.                                 
OL,14,CTuesday:FCloudy, with patchy rain at   
OL,15,Ffirst in the west. Cloud will break in 
OL,16,Fthe east during the afternoon with     
OL,17,Fsunny spells, but becoming cloudy      
OL,18,Fagain overnight. Turning increasingly  
OL,19,Fbreezy.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
